WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
It's nine at night, at your
third location.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.500
A customer calls, and your
AI answers.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.160
Do you actually know what it
said?

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.340
Your vendor's report says
the call was handled.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.300
The recording might tell a
different story.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.140
Did it quote a price you
never approved?

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.960
Promise a slot nobody
checked?

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.680
Vendors grade their own
homework.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:18.580
ZeroHand tests the agents
you already run:

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.740
the after-hours line, the
chat, the follow-up.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.400
Every location you approve,
against rules you set,

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.160
starting from a baseline you
agree to.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.760
You hear the recordings
behind every finding.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:30.900
Grow the shop.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:31.880
Not the back office.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.400
ZeroHand Labs.
